SHA-256 implementation
=======================

The SHA-256 implementation vendored in this directory (sha256.h) is derived
from the public-domain SHA-256 reference implementation by Brad Conte
("crypto-algorithms", https://github.com/B-Con/crypto-algorithms), which the
author released into the public domain.

It has been reformatted into a single C++ header, namespaced under
nuka::sha256, and adapted for incremental hashing. It carries no third-party
copyright restrictions.

Public domain. No rights reserved.
